        "Rest the bridge on the six foundations at the edges of the banks. They are pins: they hold the bridge in place but let it turn.",
        "Anything else is up to you, inside the orange box: an arch below the road, or a truss each side of it. The trucks are about 2 m wide, so keep members above the road out of its middle.",
